## Chromium source (main, fetched 2026-11-22; WebView 157 may differ)
media/audio/android/audio_manager_android.cc, MakeLowLatencyOutputStream:
  const aaudio_usage_t usage = communication_mode_is_on_ ? AAUDIO_USAGE_VOICE_COMMUNICATION : AAUDIO_USAGE_MEDIA;
MakeLinearOutputStream always passes AAUDIO_USAGE_MEDIA. GetAudioOutputDeviceNames returns only "default" on phones
(kAAudioPerStreamDeviceSelection is desktop-only), so a page can't pick an output device (no setSinkId lever).
The page and the app have no way to choose the usage; the phone's records above show MEDIA for this call.

